OL,3,AElectrical items caused fatal fire,
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house fire on Boxing Day last year
OL,7,Fwhich killed a woman and her two
OL,8,Fchildren is believed to have been
OL,9,Fcaused by electrical appliances, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FFionnghuala Mary Shearman, 38, known as
OL,13,FNu, her seven-year-old daughter Eve and
OL,14,Fher son Ohner, four, died at their home
OL,15,Fin Brimscombe, Gloucestershire, in the
OL,16,Fearly hours of 26 December last year.
OL,18,FPartner and serving police officer Tom
OL,19,FShearman, escaped and tried to re-enter
OL,20,Fthe house multiple times to save his
OL,21,Fwife and children, but was unable to
OL,22,Fdue to the severity of the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
