OL,3,AElectrical items caused fatal fire,
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeroy Hughes, from Gloucestershire Fire
OL,7,Fand Rescue Service said items such as
OL,8,Fsoft furnishings and the Christmas tree
OL,9,Fwould likely have fueled the flames.
